---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @notes = edit_box "two\nlines"
end
----------- test code
node = a11y_nodes.find { |n| n[:role] == "multiline_text_input" }
assert_equal "two\nlines", node[:value]
